{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And his offering.</b> The extra vav: so that he not grow arrogant over having merited to offer first. Therefore it is written וקרבנו, which implies there is another who preceded him. And the vav adds to the first matter, and therefore also, 'nasi' is not mentioned regarding him, as with the others." "<b>One silver dish, etc.</b> Corresponding to Jochebed, who was 130 years old." "<b>One silver basin.</b> Corresponding to Moses, who was equivalent to seventy elders." "<b>Both of them full.</b> One might think Aaron is not like him — thus you learn: 'both of them full' — both of them are equal."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:00.052857289Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}